{"id":"enfermedad","lemma":"enfermedad","pos":"noun","rank":1034,"glosses":["illness, disease"],"ipa":"/enfeɾmeˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"enfermedades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-enfermedad.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Has tenido alguna enfermedad grave?","en":"Have you had any serious illnesses?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456790","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null,{"g":"serious, grave"}]},{"text":"Él murió de esa enfermedad.","en":"He died of that disease.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70180","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"El cáncer de mama es una enfermedad.","en":"Breast cancer is a disease.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639331","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"cancer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"mamma, breast"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Nos enfrentamos a nuevos tipos de enfermedades.","en":"We are faced with new kinds of diseases.","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to confront, to face","l":"enfrentar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"new","l":"nuevo"},{"g":"kind","l":"tipo"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"La enfermedad le hizo dejar los estudios.","en":"Illness made him give up his studies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689021","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to leave"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"study","l":"estudio"}]}]}